// TEGA PLUS: public site (RU / BY / EN).
// Run:  mlog serve site/main.mlog
// Static files (/static/*, /media/*, robots.txt, sitemap.xml) are served by the reverse proxy (deploy/Caddyfile.render).
//
// Conventions (see docs/mlog-findings.md):
//  - render() always escapes; template_render() with {{{ raw }}} is for trusted fragments only. All page text goes through {{ }}.
//  - A route returns an Html value directly (`return Page(...)`).
//  - Page templates are Strings; the shell (head, header, footer) wraps the page body into ONE template_render call.
//  - Texts live in the Dict* patterns, one per language; adding a text means adding the key to all three.

